		<Row Tag="LOC_POCD_STOCK_BIND_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Unique items named in the ability of the leader or the civilization stay with them in the draft (Kristina: Queen's Bibliotheque, Korea: Seowon). If both name an item of the same type, the leader's item stays. Off: free draft.</Text></Row>
